# platform.rp2350_touch_lcd_28.sdcard

The RP2350-Touch-LCD-2.8's TF socket in its native 4-bit SD mode through
mm.sdcard's SdioCard on mm.mcu's sdio facility: clock GP19, CMD GP20, and
DAT0 to DAT3 on GP21 to GP24, from Waveshare's schematic. Hardware SPI
cannot reach this socket -- GP19 is an SPI transmit position, GP20 a
receive one -- so SD mode over PIO is its only transport. rp2350_touch_lcd_28
binds it. The card is identified at 400 kHz and runs at 25 MHz.
